">only </span><span begin="00:10.810" end="00:11.080">took </span><span begin="00:11.080" end="00:11.140">a </span><span begin="00:11.140" end="00:11.560">couple </span><span begin="00:11.560" end="00:12.190">weeks</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.190" end="00:16.540"><span begin="00:12.190" end="00:12.610">Remember </span><span begin="00:12.610" end="00:12.880">when </span><span begin="00:12.880" end="00:12.970">you </span><span begin="00:12.970" end="00:13.180">said </span><span begin="00:13.180" end="00:13.390">that </span><span begin="00:13.390" end="00:13.540">you </span><span begin="00:13.540" end="00:13.870">wanted </span><span begin="00:13.870" end="00:14.020">to </span><span begin="00:14.020" end="00:14.320">give </span><span begin="00:14.320" end="00:14.530">me </span><span begin="00:14.530" end="00:14.740">the </span><span begin="00:14.740" end="00:16.540">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.860" end="00:20.650"><span begin="00:17.860" end="00:17.950">And </span><span begin="00:17.950" end="00:18.130">good </span><span begin="00:18.130" end="00:18.310">for </span><span begin="00:18.310" end="00:18.550">you</span><span begin="00:18.550" end="00:18.550">, </span><span begin="00:18.550" end="00:18.640">I </span><span begin="00:18.640" end="00:18.880">guess </span><span begin="00:18.880" end="00:19.060">that </span><span begin="00:19.060" end="00:19.240">you've </span><span begin="00:19.240" end="00:19.390">been </span><span begin="00:19.390" end="00:19.780">working </span><span begin="00:19.780" end="00:19.960">on </span><span begin="00:19.960" end="00:20.650">yourself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.680" end="00:23.470"><span begin="00:20.680" end="00:20.770">I </span><span begin="00:20.770" end="00:21.010">guess </span><span begin="00:21.010" end="00:21.130">that </span><span begin="00:21.130" end="00:21.760">therapist </span><span begin="00:21.760" end="00:21.820">I </span><span begin="00:21.820" end="00:22.120">found </span><span begin="00:22.120" end="00:22.210">for </span><span begin="00:22.210" end="00:22.390">you</span><span begin="00:22.390" end="00:22.390">, </span><span begin="00:22.390" end="00:22.540">she </span><span begin="00:22.540" end="00:22.930">really </span><span begin="00:22.930" end="00:23.470">helped</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.470" end="00:28.660"><span begin="00:23.470" end="00:23.620">Now </span><span begin="00:23.620" end="00:23.770">you </span><span begin="00:23.770" end="00:23.980">can </span><span begin="00:23.980" end="00:24.250">be </span><span begin="00:24.250" end="00:24.340">a </span><span begin="00:24.340" end="00:24.640">better </span><span begin="00:24.640" end="00:25.090">man </span><span begin="00:25.090" end="00:25.210">for </span><span begin="00:25.210" end="00:25.390">your </span><span begin="00:25.390" end="00:25.810">brand </span><span begin="00:25.810" end="00:26.080">new </span><span begin="00:26.080" end="00:28.660">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.320" end="00:30.550"><span begin="00:29.320" end="00:29.620">Well </span><span begin="00:29.620" end="00:29.860">good </span><span begin="00:29.860" end="00:30.130">for </span><span begin="00:30.130" end="00:30.550">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.550" end="00:33.310"><span begin="00:30.550" end="00:30.730">You </span><span begin="00:30.730" end="00:30.910">look </span><span begin="00:30.910" end="00:31.540">happy </span><span begin="00:31.540" end="00:31.660">and </span><span begin="00:31.660" end="00:32.470">healthy</span><span begin="00:32.470" end="00:32.470">, </span><span begin="00:32.470" end="00:32.980">not </span><span begin="00:32.980" end="00:33.310">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.310" end="00:35.230"><span begin="00:33.310" end="00:33.490">If </span><span begin="00:33.490" end="00:33.730">you </span><span begin="00:33.730" end="00:33.940">ever </span><span begin="00:33.940" end="00:34.390">cared </span><span begin="00:34.390" end="00:34.510">to </span><span begin="00:34.510" end="00:35.230">ask</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.380" end="00:36.280"><span begin="00:35.380" end="00:35.620">Good </span><span begin="00:35.620" end="00:35.890">for </span><span begin="00:35.890" end="00:36.280">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.280" end="00:39.010"><span begin="00:36.280" end="00:36.520">You're </span><span begin="00:36.520" end="00:36.880">doing </span><span begin="00:36.880" end="00:37.180">great </span><span begin="00:37.180" end="00:37.270">out </span><span begin="00:37.270" end="00:37.480">there </span><span begin="00:37.480" end="00:38.020">without </span><span begin="00:38.020" end="00:38.290">me</span><span begin="00:38.290" end="00:38.290">, </span><span begin="00:38.290" end="00:39.010">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.010" end="00:40.840"><span begin="00:39.010" end="00:39.370">God</span><span begin="00:39.370" end="00:39.370">, </span><span begin="00:39.370" end="00:39.430">I </span><span begin="00:39.430" end="00:39.610">wish </span><span begin="00:39.610" end="00:39.850">that </span><span begin="00:39.850" end="00:40.030">I </span><span begin="00:40.030" end="00:40.150">could </span><span begin="00:40.150" end="00:40.330">do </span><span begin="00:40.330" end="00:40.840">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.870" end="00:42.400"><span begin="00:40.870" end="00:41.230">I've </span><span begin="00:41.230" end="00:41.620">lost </span><span begin="00:41.620" end="00:41.920">my </span><span begin="00:41.920" end="00:42.400">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.400" end="00:43.720"><span begin="00:42.400" end="00:42.580">I've </span><span begin="00:42.580" end="00:43.030">spent </span><span begin="00:43.030" end="00:43.210">the </span><span begin="00:43.210" end="00:43.720">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.720" end="00:46.690"><span begin="00:43.720" end="00:44.530">Crying </span><span begin="00:44.530" end="00:44.710">on </span><span begin="00:44.710" end="00:44.800">the </span><span begin="00:44.800" end="00:45.280">floor </span><span begin="00:45.280" end="00:45.400">of </span><span begin="00:45.400" end="00:45.730">my </span><span begin="00:45.730" end="00:46.690">bathroom</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.690" end="00:49.750"><span begin="00:46.690" end="00:46.870">But </span><span begin="00:46.870" end="00:46.960">you're </span><span begin="00:46.960" end="00:47.290">so </span><span begin="00:47.290" end="00:48.190">unaffected</span><span begin="00:48.190" end="00:48.190">, </span><span begin="00:48.190" end="00:48.280">I </span><span begin="00:48.280" end="00:48.850">really </span><span begin="00:48.850" end="00:49.150">don't </span><span begin="00:49.150" end="00:49.660">get </span><span begin="00:49.660" end="00:49.750">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.750" end="00:53.440"><span begin="00:49.750" end="00:49.900">But </span><span begin="00:49.900" end="00:50.260">I </span><span begin="00:50.260" end="00:50.620">guess </span><span begin="00:50.620" end="00:50.980">good </span><span begin="00:50.980" end="00:51.250">for </span><span begin="00:51.250" end="00:53.440">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.060" end="01:00.940"><span begin="00:58.060" end="00:58.210">Well </span><span begin="00:58.210" end="00:58.360">good </span><span begin="00:58.360" end="00:58.510">for </span><span begin="00:58.510" end="00:58.780">you</span><span begin="00:58.780" end="00:58.780">, </span><span begin="00:58.780" end="00:58.900">I </span><span begin="00:58.900" end="00:59.140">guess </span><span begin="00:59.140" end="00:59.260">you're </span><span begin="00:59.260" end="00:59.710">getting </span><span begin="00:59.710" end="01:00.160">everything </span><span begin="01:00.160" end="01:00.340">you </span><span begin="01:00.340" end="01:00.940">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.940" end="01:03.790"><span begin="01:00.940" end="01:01.060">You </span><span begin="01:01.060" end="01:01.330">bought </span><span begin="01:01.330" end="01:01.390">a </span><span begin="01:01.390" end="01:01.540">new </span><span begin="01:01.540" end="01:01.870">car </span><span begin="01:01.870" end="01:01.960">and </span><span begin="01:01.960" end="01:02.080">your </span><span begin="01:02.080" end="01:02.530">career's </span><span begin="01:02.530" end="01:02.770">really </span><span begin="01:02.770" end="01:03.280">taking </span><span begin="01:03.280" end="01:03.790">off</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.790" end="01:05.650"><span begin="01:03.790" end="01:03.940">It's </span><span begin="01:03.940" end="01:04.090">like </span><span begin="01:04.090" end="01:04.210">we </span><span begin="01:04.210" end="01:04.600">never </span><span begin="01:04.600" end="01:04.960">even </span><span begin="01:04.960" end="01:05.320">happened</span><span begin="01:05.320" end="01:05.320">, </span><span begin="01:05.320" end="01:05.650">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.650" end="01:09.400"><span begin="01:05.650" end="01:06.040">What </span><span begin="01:06.040" end="01:06.250">the </span><span begin="01:06.250" end="01:06.400">fu</span><span begin="01:06.400" end="01:06.400">*</span><span begin="01:06.400" end="01:06.880">k </span><span begin="01:06.880" end="01:07.120">is </span><span begin="01:07.120" end="01:07.540">up </span><span begin="01:07.540" end="01:07.810">with </span><span begin="01:07.810" end="01:08.350">that</span><span begin="01:08.350" end="01:09.400">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.400" end="01:12.190"><span begin="01:09.400" end="01:09.520">And </span><span begin="01:09.520" end="01:09.730">good </span><span begin="01:09.730" end="01:09.880">for </span><span begin="01:09.880" end="01:10.120">you</span><span begin="01:10.120" end="01:10.120">, </span><span begin="01:10.120" end="01:10.300">it's </span><span begin="01:10.300" end="01:10.510">like </span><span begin="01:10.510" end="01:10.600">you </span><span begin